# 15. MONETISATION AND RETENTION

The initial priority is a complete, enjoyable playable game.

Start with:
- Free gameplay.
- Local score tracking.
- Permanent coin upgrades.
- Cosmetic unlocks.
- Daily challenges as a later enhancement.
- Optional rewarded advertising only if a compliant advertising integration is added.

Do not build mandatory advertisements into the first prototype.

Avoid pay-to-win upgrades. Purchases should not be required to complete the introductory escape sequence.

Retention features:
- Personal-best records.
- New gadget unlocks.
- Character cosmetics.
- Randomised city combinations.
- Daily or rotating objectives.
- Distance milestones.
- Achievement badges.
- New police behaviours.
- Alternative escape routes.

Every run should introduce variation without changing the basic controls.

